{"id":"n24031-2-7","stage":3,"title":"교대 · 接班的人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24031-2-7-1","ko":"벌써 여섯 신데 아직 퇴근도 못했어?","zh":"已经六点了，还没能下班吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여섯","meaning":"六","explanation":"여섯：六","readings":[{"term":"여섯","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29614","senseId":"1","lemma":"여섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신데","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"퇴근도","meaning":"下班","explanation":"퇴근：下班；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"퇴근","audio":"/audio/344e3166df7e6c4b52ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71296","senseId":"1","lemma":"퇴근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못했어?","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"e3da184cbf43240a","term":"여섯","zh":"六","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3","entryId":"29614","definition":"五加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["여섣"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"344e3166df7e6c4b","term":"퇴근","zh":"下班","audio":"/audio/344e3166df7e6c4b52ba.mp3","entryId":"71296","definition":"做完岗位上的工作，返回家里。","pronunciation":["퇴ː근","퉤ː근"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cfc6cd16b6d6da1321ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24031-2-7-2","ko":"응. 다음 교대가 아직 안 와서 못 가고 있어.","zh":"嗯。下一次轮班的人还没到，所以暂时走不了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"又不是","explanation":"다음：又不是","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"7","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교대가","meaning":"接班的人","explanation":"교대：接班的人；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"교대","audio":"/audio/d3b06ef91a4ec47fd57c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24031","senseId":"2","lemma":"교대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},